## Witch potions

reagent-name-witch-love = love potion
reagent-desc-witch-love = A syrupy pink brew that sets the heart racing and knits small wounds closed.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-love = sweet and rosy

reagent-name-witch-paranoia = paranoia draught
reagent-desc-witch-paranoia = A murky violet tincture that fills the drinker with the certainty of being watched.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-paranoia = restless

reagent-name-witch-rage = rage philtre
reagent-desc-witch-rage = Boiling crimson fury in a bottle. The drinker lashes out at whatever stands closest.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-rage = seething

reagent-name-witch-invisibility = potion of invisibility
reagent-desc-witch-invisibility = A deep indigo draught that thins the drinker until light passes straight through.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-invisibility = barely visible

reagent-name-witch-mind-fog = mind fog
reagent-desc-witch-mind-fog = A dull grey vapourous liquid that smothers thought and blurs the senses.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-mind-fog = hazy

reagent-name-witch-mirror-curse = mirror curse
reagent-desc-witch-mirror-curse = A glassy blue curse that turns harm back upon whoever deals it.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-mirror-curse = mirror-bright

reagent-name-witch-blood-bond = blood bond
reagent-desc-witch-blood-bond = Dark arterial red. Binds two fates together so that one feels what the other suffers.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-blood-bond = thick and clotted

reagent-name-witch-soul-shadow = soul shadow
reagent-desc-witch-soul-shadow = Light will not settle on this liquid. It drinks the soul as readily as the soul drinks it.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-soul-shadow = lightless

reagent-name-witch-substitution = substitution brew
reagent-desc-witch-substitution = A shimmering azure draught that swaps the drinker's place with another.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-substitution = shifting

reagent-name-witch-black-bile = black bile
reagent-desc-witch-black-bile = The bitter humour of melancholy, distilled until it is blacker than pitch.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-black-bile = tarry

reagent-name-witch-echo = echo draught
reagent-desc-witch-echo = A pale, ringing liquid that repeats back whatever it is given.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-echo = ringing

reagent-name-witch-name-curse = name curse
reagent-desc-witch-name-curse = A colourless curse that strips the drinker of the name they answer to.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-name-curse = nameless

reagent-name-witch-hunger-potion = hunger potion
reagent-desc-witch-hunger-potion = A golden syrup that hollows out the stomach no matter how recently it was filled.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-hunger-potion = gnawing

reagent-name-witch-serenity = serenity tea
reagent-desc-witch-serenity = A calm sky-blue infusion that settles frayed nerves and steadies the hands.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-serenity = tranquil

reagent-name-witch-inspiration = inspiration philtre
reagent-desc-witch-inspiration = Liquid gold that fills the mind with ideas faster than it can catch them.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-inspiration = glittering

reagent-name-witch-wisdom = wisdom draught
reagent-desc-witch-wisdom = A dark violet distillate. Bitter to drink, and bitterer in what it teaches.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-wisdom = deep and still

reagent-name-witch-starlight-potion = starlight potion
reagent-desc-witch-starlight-potion = Bottled nightsky, faintly luminous, sweet as a clear winter evening.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-starlight-potion = faintly glowing

reagent-name-witch-hope = hope potion
reagent-desc-witch-hope = A warm rosy cordial that makes the next hour seem survivable.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-hope = warm and bright

reagent-name-witch-compassion = compassion elixir
reagent-desc-witch-compassion = A vivid pink elixir that turns the drinker's hurts outward into care for others.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-compassion = gentle

reagent-name-witch-clarity = clarity solution
reagent-desc-witch-clarity = Clear as meltwater. Cuts through confusion, poison and illusion alike.
reagent-physical-desc-witch-clarity = crystal clear

## Alchemist reagents

reagent-name-alchemist-acid = alchemical acid
reagent-desc-alchemist-acid = A sharp yellow-green acid brewed for dissolving what ordinary solvents will not.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-acid = fuming

reagent-name-alchemist-philosopher-stone = philosopher's stone solution
reagent-desc-alchemist-philosopher-stone = The great work, rendered liquid. It transmutes whatever it is allowed to touch.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-philosopher-stone = molten gold

reagent-name-alchemist-magic-neutralizer = magic neutralizer
reagent-desc-alchemist-magic-neutralizer = A pale astringent wash that strips enchantment out of flesh and matter.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-magic-neutralizer = flat and inert

reagent-name-alchemist-catalyst = alchemical catalyst
reagent-desc-alchemist-catalyst = A restless green fluid that hurries every reaction it is added to.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-catalyst = bubbling

reagent-name-alchemist-soul-copperas = soul copperas
reagent-desc-alchemist-soul-copperas = Blue-green vitriol crystals dissolved in spirit. Traditionally used to fix a soul in place.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-soul-copperas = metallic and cold

reagent-name-alchemist-bubble-gas = bubble gas
reagent-desc-alchemist-bubble-gas = A pearly grey gas that froths into a thick cushioning foam on contact with air.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-bubble-gas = frothing

reagent-name-alchemist-gravity-potion = gravity potion
reagent-desc-alchemist-gravity-potion = A leaden draught that makes the drinker far heavier than they have any right to be.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-gravity-potion = impossibly heavy

reagent-name-alchemist-clown-trail = clown trail
reagent-desc-alchemist-clown-trail = A slippery yellow slick left behind by something that was laughing as it ran.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-clown-trail = slippery

reagent-name-alchemist-clown-trail-residue = clown trail residue
reagent-desc-alchemist-clown-trail-residue = The tacky yellow remains of a clown trail, still faintly squeaking.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-clown-trail-residue = tacky

reagent-name-alchemist-chaos-salt = chaos salt
reagent-desc-alchemist-chaos-salt = Pale crystals that refuse to react the same way twice.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-chaos-salt = crystalline

reagent-name-alchemist-mimic-juice = mimic juice
reagent-desc-alchemist-mimic-juice = A blank ivory fluid that copies the properties of whatever it is mixed with.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-mimic-juice = featureless

reagent-name-alchemist-mimic-juice-residue = mimic juice residue
reagent-desc-alchemist-mimic-juice-residue = Spent mimic juice, still faintly holding the shape of its last imitation.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-mimic-juice-residue = faintly patterned

reagent-name-alchemist-nitric-essence = nitric essence
reagent-desc-alchemist-nitric-essence = A biting pale-blue essence distilled from aqua fortis. It burns going down.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-nitric-essence = acrid

reagent-name-alchemist-magnus-elixir = magnus elixir
reagent-desc-alchemist-magnus-elixir = The alchemist's great elixir, warm and golden, mending what it is poured into.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-magnus-elixir = warm and golden

reagent-name-alchemist-courage = draught of courage
reagent-desc-alchemist-courage = A hot red draught that leaves no room in the chest for fear.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-courage = burning

reagent-name-alchemist-determination = draught of determination
reagent-desc-alchemist-determination = A deep blue draught that keeps the drinker upright long after they should have fallen.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-determination = unyielding

reagent-name-alchemist-elixir-of-life = elixir of life
reagent-desc-alchemist-elixir-of-life = The prize at the end of the great work. It calls the body back from the edge.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-elixir-of-life = vividly alive

reagent-name-alchemist-alchemical-explosion = alchemical explosion
reagent-desc-alchemist-alchemical-explosion = An unstable orange concentrate. It is already too late to put it down.
reagent-physical-desc-alchemist-alchemical-explosion = violently unstable

## Interaction products

reagent-name-interaction-cursed-salt = cursed salt
reagent-desc-interaction-cursed-salt = Salt soured by a curse it was never meant to carry.
reagent-physical-desc-interaction-cursed-salt = dull and grey

reagent-name-interaction-anti-magic = antimagic solution
reagent-desc-interaction-anti-magic = A cold blue solution that smothers magic wherever it settles.
reagent-physical-desc-interaction-anti-magic = quenching

reagent-name-interaction-holy-remedy = holy remedy
reagent-desc-interaction-holy-remedy = A soft golden remedy that cleanses affliction and curse together.
reagent-physical-desc-interaction-holy-remedy = blessed

reagent-name-interaction-chaos-mixture = chaos mixture
reagent-desc-interaction-chaos-mixture = A churning violet mixture whose effects nobody has ever managed to write down twice.
reagent-physical-desc-interaction-chaos-mixture = unpredictable
